            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Regional hypothermia was used in the complex treatment of pain syndromes in patients with lumbosacral radiculitis, radiculalgias, neuralgias. Positive results of antalgic therapy in diseases of the peripheral nervous system allow to recommend this method of treatment for wider employment.</AbstractText>
